  "content": "<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">目前，要完整體驗 Barely Default 的所有功能*，需要安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fhome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a>（或替代方案，如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fabulously-optimized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabulously Optimized 模組包</a>）</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f15c74aaa6772fdcf0482c6bab7d9614b203940b_0.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"861\" height=\"294\"></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>在 Minecraft 中體驗更多麥塊元素</strong></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\">小時候，Minecraft 的更新就像聖誕節一樣令人期待！但有時候覺得更新速度有點慢……</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">當 Story Mode 和 Dungeons 推出時，我深深沉迷於其中的新世界觀！但這些內容卻從未真正進入遊戲本體……</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pqqLxtn983g?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&amp;index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">與其等待更新，我決定親手填補這個缺口。Barely Default 將整個 Minecraft 正統世界觀串聯起來，同時忠於原版的美術風格。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">現代化外觀：我更新了那些「被遺忘」的紋理，讓它們符合 Mojang 當前更細緻的風格。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">最終成果是一個煥然一新、細節豐富，卻又令人熟悉的遊戲世界。我的目標是讓你即使使用這個材質包多年，還是能從中發現新事物！</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">名稱決定變體！</h1><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kSjHyrZ60fVfBGip9Ho6QbFmMZ1CCtDfqIQLVj4hFvM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此連結查看 Barely Default 中所有命名變體的完整清單</a></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.redd.it/s0q08ghzmtde1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"5863\" height=\"5942\"></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">也歡迎看看由 CYKLOPS 和我製作的官方 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fbarely-default-data-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Barely Default 資料包</a></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><hr><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h4><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">更多酷炫功能！</h1><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/i9FjExcZ57Y?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&amp;index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WQ73j2drgjE?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&amp;index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Th6UydWl_pM?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&amp;index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wtDQX262DZo?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&amp;index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/d4SU-ZELQAE?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&amp;index=8&amp;t=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OI9APvuQJK4?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&amp;index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IUatvyvlSZU?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&amp;index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
